 "description": "<p>Resonance is the word the listing uses, and it fits: instead of buzzing against the skin, this rose tongue vibe sends nine resonance settings through the silicone in waves that feel closer to deep hum than surface shake. Nine pulse modes layer on top, short sharp rhythms that cut through when the resonance alone is not enough.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_5_83cf12f3-7185-4ee0-ac3d-a72662d5dab3_480x480.jpg?v=1689654389\"></p>\n<p>The tongue tip is the business end. It flicks, laps, and holds contact in a way round-head vibrators cannot copy, and because the two mode systems are separate, you can park the resonance on a low setting and let the pulse patterns do the storytelling.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_2_a5e9d0c7-92c9-412d-a3fd-0c4fcf496dd0_480x480.jpg?v=1689654383\"></p>\n<p>Silica gel — soft silicone, in plain terms — covers every surface that touches skin, and the whole body carries an IPX7 rating, so bath use and full rinsing are both on the table. Charging is the magnetic-contact kind: the cable finds its own alignment.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_3_67cff6ad-f96b-44d0-937d-e40454a013d1_480x480.jpg?v=1689654387\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Resonance settings: 9</li>\n<li>Pulse modes: 9</li>\n<li>Material: soft silicone over the contact surfaces</li>\n<li>Charging: USB magnetic</li>\n<li>Waterproof: IPX7</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_1_c71bc58b-0475-4a71-8e4d-a64914286ce6_480x480.jpg?v=1689654380\" alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></p>\n<p>A tongue vibe for people who found ordinary buzz too shallow and want the rumble underneath it.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Rose tongue vibe offering 9 resonance settings and 9 pulse modes in soft silicone with IPX7 waterproofing and magnetic USB charging.</p>\n",
